<title>SINGAPORE: Lindeteves-Jacoberg in Philippines deal.</title>
<headline>Lindeteves-Jacoberg in Philippines deal.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lindeteves-Jacoberg Ltd said on Wednesday its Philippines subsidiary has entered a Singapore $4.0 million memorandum of agreement to supply power to Fiesta World Corp of Manila.</p>
<p>The project will be financed by internal funds and bank borrowings, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
